  "sunnahDuaOpenPractice": "Read practice",
  "sunnahRoutineWakeUpTitle": "Wake up",
  "sunnahRoutineWakeUpSubtitle": "Begin again with gratitude",
  "sunnahRoutineWakeUpPointsRaw": "Praise Allah as you wake.||Clean your mouth with miswak before prayer.",
  "sunnahRoutineWakeUpPractice": "Make the waking du'a your first words of the day.",
  "sunnahRoutineWashroomTitle": "Washroom",
  "sunnahRoutineWashroomSubtitle": "Care for cleanliness and privacy",
  "sunnahRoutineWashroomPointsRaw": "Read the du'a before entering the washroom.||Use the left hand for cleaning after relieving yourself.||After leaving, ask Allah for forgiveness.",
  "sunnahRoutineWashroomPractice": "Learn the short duas for entering and leaving.",
  "sunnahRoutineMiswakTitle": "Miswak",
  "sunnahRoutineMiswakSubtitle": "A fresh start before worship",
  "sunnahRoutineMiswakPointsRaw": "Use miswak after waking.||Clean your mouth with miswak before prayer.",
  "sunnahRoutineMiswakPractice": "Keep your miswak clean and within reach.",
  "sunnahRoutineWuduTitle": "Wudu",
  "sunnahRoutineWuduSubtitle": "Prepare for prayer with care",
  "sunnahRoutineWuduPointsRaw": "Wash the hands, rinse the mouth and nose, then wash the face and arms.||Wipe the head and wash the feet as taught in wudu.||Complete wudu carefully, then recite the testimony of faith.",
  "sunnahRoutineWuduPractice": "Learn the complete method of wudu; these reminders include both essential acts and Sunnah details.",
  "sunnahRoutineDressingTitle": "Getting dressed",
  "sunnahRoutineDressingSubtitle": "Begin with the right side",
  "sunnahRoutineDressingPointsRaw": "Start with the right side when putting on shoes and tending to your appearance.||Put on the right shoe first and remove the left shoe first.",
  "sunnahRoutineDressingPractice": "Let getting ready become a small, consistent Sunnah habit.",
  "sunnahRoutineAdhanTitle": "Hearing the adhan",
  "sunnahRoutineAdhanSubtitle": "Pause and answer the call",
  "sunnahRoutineAdhanPointsRaw": "Repeat the caller's words.||At the calls to prayer and success, say la hawla wa la quwwata illa billah.||After the adhan, send blessings upon the Prophet ﷺ and ask Allah to grant him al-Wasilah.",
  "sunnahRoutineAdhanPractice": "Pause other conversation long enough to listen and respond.",
  "sunnahRoutineMasjidTitle": "At the masjid",
  "sunnahRoutineMasjidSubtitle": "Arrive with calm and reverence",
  "sunnahRoutineMasjidPointsRaw": "Walk to prayer calmly, even if the prayer has begun.||Ask Allah to open the doors of His mercy when entering.||Pray two rak'ahs before sitting when appropriate.||When leaving, ask Allah for His bounty.",
  "sunnahRoutineMasjidPractice": "Keep the space peaceful for other worshippers.",
  "sunnahRoutineAfterPrayerTitle": "After salah",
  "sunnahRoutineAfterPrayerSubtitle": "Stay a little longer in remembrance",
  "sunnahRoutineAfterPrayerPointsRaw": "Ask Allah for forgiveness three times after the prayer.||Recite Allahumma antas-salam wa minkas-salam.||Say Subhanallah, Alhamdulillah and Allahu akbar 33 times each, completing a hundred with the reported declaration of Allah's oneness.",
  "sunnahRoutineAfterPrayerPractice": "Learn one complete, authentic form of the post-prayer adhkar.",
  "sunnahRoutineMorningTitle": "Morning dhikr",
  "sunnahRoutineMorningSubtitle": "Carry remembrance into your day",
  "sunnahRoutineMorningPointsRaw": "Say Subhanallahi wa bihamdihi one hundred times in the morning.",
  "sunnahRoutineMorningPractice": "Use the Morning & evening collection for the Arabic and meaning.",
  "sunnahRoutineDuhaTitle": "Duha prayer",
  "sunnahRoutineDuhaSubtitle": "A quiet pause in the forenoon",
  "sunnahRoutineDuhaPointsRaw": "Pray two rak'ahs of Duha during the forenoon, after the sun has risen sufficiently and before the sun reaches its zenith.",
  "sunnahRoutineDuhaPractice": "Choose a regular time within the Duha window that fits your day.",
  "sunnahRoutineLeavingHomeTitle": "Leaving home",
  "sunnahRoutineLeavingHomeSubtitle": "Step outside with trust",
  "sunnahRoutineLeavingHomePointsRaw": "Say the du'a for leaving home.||Remember that strength and ability come from Allah.",
  "sunnahRoutineLeavingHomePractice": "Make the doorway a reminder to place your trust in Allah.",
  "sunnahRoutineEatingTitle": "Eating",
  "sunnahRoutineEatingSubtitle": "Bring Sunnah to the table",
  "sunnahRoutineEatingPointsRaw": "Mention Allah's name before eating.||Eat with your right hand and from the food nearest to you.||Do not criticize food.||Eat moderately.",
  "sunnahRoutineEatingPractice": "Use each meal as a reminder to practise these manners.",
  "sunnahRoutineDrinkingTitle": "Drinking water",
  "sunnahRoutineDrinkingSubtitle": "Small sips, sincere gratitude",
  "sunnahRoutineDrinkingPointsRaw": "Drink with the right hand.||Pause between sips to breathe away from the vessel.||Praise Allah after drinking.",
  "sunnahRoutineDrinkingPractice": "Take your time and keep your breath out of the cup.",
  "sunnahRoutineGreetingsTitle": "Salam & a smile",
  "sunnahRoutineGreetingsSubtitle": "Make kindness your greeting",
  "sunnahRoutineGreetingsPointsRaw": "Spread salam among people.||Meet others with a warm smile.",
  "sunnahRoutineGreetingsPractice": "Begin ordinary encounters with care and respect.",
  "sunnahRoutineSpeechTitle": "Mindful speech",
  "sunnahRoutineSpeechSubtitle": "Speak well and with gentleness",
  "sunnahRoutineSpeechPointsRaw": "Say what is good or remain silent.||Be gentle in your words and dealings.",
  "sunnahRoutineSpeechPractice": "Pause before speaking when you feel upset.",
  "sunnahRoutineSneezingTitle": "Sneezing & yawning",
  "sunnahRoutineSneezingSubtitle": "Gratitude in a small moment",
  "sunnahRoutineSneezingPointsRaw": "After sneezing, say Alhamdulillah.||A Muslim who hears it responds Yarhamukallah; the sneezer replies Yahdikumullahu wa yuslihu balakum.||Cover your mouth when yawning.",
  "sunnahRoutineSneezingPractice": "Learn both parts of the exchange so you can respond with care.",
  "sunnahRoutineReturningHomeTitle": "Returning home",
  "sunnahRoutineReturningHomeSubtitle": "Enter with remembrance and salam",
  "sunnahRoutineReturningHomePointsRaw": "Mention Allah when entering your home.||Greet the people at home with salam.",
  "sunnahRoutineReturningHomePractice": "Begin your return with a peaceful greeting.",
  "sunnahRoutineFamilyTitle": "Time with family",
  "sunnahRoutineFamilySubtitle": "Kindness begins at home",
  "sunnahRoutineFamilyPointsRaw": "Help with the work of your household.||Treat your family with kindness.",
  "sunnahRoutineFamilyPractice": "Choose one useful household task and do it with care.",
  "sunnahRoutineEveningTitle": "Evening dhikr",
  "sunnahRoutineEveningSubtitle": "Welcome the evening with remembrance",
  "sunnahRoutineEveningPointsRaw": "Say Subhanallahi wa bihamdihi one hundred times in the evening.",
  "sunnahRoutineEveningPractice": "Return to the Morning & evening collection as the day draws to a close.",
  "sunnahRoutineNightSafetyTitle": "Settle the home",
  "sunnahRoutineNightSafetySubtitle": "A little care before bedtime",
  "sunnahRoutineNightSafetyPointsRaw": "Cover food and drink vessels.||Close the doors before sleeping.||Extinguish lamps with flames and other open fires safely.",
  "sunnahRoutineNightSafetyPractice": "Include these steps in your nightly household routine.",
  "sunnahRoutineBedtimeRecitationTitle": "Bedtime recitation",
  "sunnahRoutineBedtimeRecitationSubtitle": "Close the day with Quran",
  "sunnahRoutineBedtimeRecitationPointsRaw": "Recite Al-Ikhlas, Al-Falaq and An-Nas into cupped hands, blow lightly and wipe over the body; repeat three times.||Recite Ayat al-Kursi before sleeping.||Recite the final two verses of Al-Baqarah at night.",
  "sunnahRoutineBedtimeRecitationPractice": "Learn these passages gradually and keep the routine steady.",
  "sunnahRoutineSleepTitle": "Go to sleep",
  "sunnahRoutineSleepSubtitle": "Rest with trust in Allah",
  "sunnahRoutineSleepPointsRaw": "Perform wudu before going to bed.||Dust the bed before lying down.||Lie on your right side and recite the sleeping du'a.",
  "sunnahRoutineSleepPractice": "Keep the routine simple enough to follow on tired nights.",
  "sunnahRoutineForgivenessTitle": "Seeking forgiveness",
  "sunnahRoutineForgivenessSubtitle": "Return to Allah, again and again",
  "sunnahRoutineForgivenessPointsRaw": "Make seeking forgiveness a regular part of your day.||Turn back sincerely and try to leave the wrong behind.",
  "sunnahRoutineForgivenessPractice": "The Prophet ﷺ sought forgiveness and repented to Allah a hundred times a day.",
  "sunnahRoutineDifficultyTitle": "In difficulty",
  "sunnahRoutineDifficultySubtitle": "Words of trust when life feels heavy",
  "sunnahRoutineDifficultyPointsRaw": "Recite this du'a in distress.||Reflect on Allah's greatness and forbearance.",
  "sunnahRoutineDifficultyPractice": "Read slowly and attentively when facing hardship.",
  "sunnahRoutineMorningEveningTitle": "Morning & evening",
  "sunnahRoutineMorningEveningSubtitle": "A daily rhythm of remembrance",
  "sunnahRoutineMorningEveningPointsRaw": "Say Subhanallahi wa bihamdihi one hundred times in the morning and one hundred times in the evening.",
  "sunnahRoutineMorningEveningPractice": "Keep a quiet moment for remembrance at both ends of your day.",
  "sunnahRoutineGratitudeTitle": "Gratitude",
  "sunnahRoutineGratitudeSubtitle": "Notice the blessings around you",
  "sunnahRoutineGratitudePointsRaw": "Ask Allah to help you be thankful.||Ask for the ability to do good deeds that please Him.",
  "sunnahRoutineGratitudePractice": "This Quranic supplication is from the prayer of Sulayman عليه السلام.",
  "sunnahRoutineFastingTitle": "Sunnah fasting",
  "sunnahRoutineFastingSubtitle": "Make room for voluntary worship",
  "sunnahRoutineFastingPointsRaw": "Take suhur and break your fast promptly once the sun has set.||Consider fasting on Mondays when able.||Learn about the six fasts of Shawwal.",
  "sunnahRoutineFastingPractice": "Build a sustainable voluntary practice alongside your obligations.",
