  "sunnahRecitationWakeArabic": "الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ الَّذِي أَحْيَانَا بَعْدَ مَا أَمَاتَنَا وَإِلَيْهِ النُّشُورُ",
  "sunnahRecitationWakePronunciation": "Alhamdu lillahil-ladhi ahyana ba'da ma amatana wa ilayhin-nushur.",
  "sunnahRecitationWakeTranslation": "Praise belongs to Allah, who gave us life after causing us to die; to Him is the resurrection.",
  "sunnahRecitationWashroomArabic": "اللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي أَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنَ الْخُبُثِ وَالْخَبَائِثِ\n\nغُفْرَانَكَ",
  "sunnahRecitationWashroomPronunciation": "Before entering: Allahumma inni a'udhu bika minal-khubuthi wal-khaba'ith.\nAfter leaving: Ghufranak.",
  "sunnahRecitationWashroomTranslation": "Before entering: O Allah, I seek Your protection from male and female devils.\nAfter leaving: I ask Your forgiveness.",
  "sunnahRecitationWuduArabic": "أَشْهَدُ أَنْ لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ وَحْدَهُ لَا شَرِيكَ لَهُ وَأَشْهَدُ أَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا عَبْدُهُ وَرَسُولُهُ",
  "sunnahRecitationWuduPronunciation": "Ashhadu an la ilaha illallahu wahdahu la sharika lahu, wa ashhadu anna Muhammadan 'abduhu wa rasuluh.",
  "sunnahRecitationWuduTranslation": "I testify that none is worthy of worship but Allah alone, without partner, and that Muhammad is His servant and messenger.",
  "sunnahRecitationMasjidArabic": "اللَّهُمَّ افْتَحْ لِي أَبْوَابَ رَحْمَتِكَ\n\nاللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي أَسْأَلُكَ مِنْ فَضْلِكَ",
  "sunnahRecitationMasjidPronunciation": "Entering: Allahummaftah li abwaba rahmatik.\nLeaving: Allahumma inni as'aluka min fadlik.",
  "sunnahRecitationMasjidTranslation": "Entering: O Allah, open the doors of Your mercy for me.\nLeaving: O Allah, I ask You for Your bounty.",
  "sunnahRecitationAfterPrayerArabic": "أَسْتَغْفِرُ اللَّهَ\nاللَّهُمَّ أَنْتَ السَّلَامُ وَمِنْكَ السَّلَامُ تَبَارَكْتَ ذَا الْجَلَالِ وَالْإِكْرَامِ",
  "sunnahRecitationAfterPrayerPronunciation": "Astaghfirullah (three times).\nAllahumma antas-salamu wa minkas-salam, tabarakta dhal-jalali wal-ikram.",
  "sunnahRecitationAfterPrayerTranslation": "I ask Allah's forgiveness.\nO Allah, You are Peace and from You comes peace. Blessed are You, Possessor of majesty and honour.",
  "sunnahRecitationLeavingHomeArabic": "بِسْمِ اللَّهِ تَوَكَّلْتُ عَلَى اللَّهِ وَلَا حَوْلَ وَلَا قُوَّةَ إِلَّا بِاللَّهِ",
  "sunnahRecitationLeavingHomePronunciation": "Bismillahi tawakkaltu 'alallah, wa la hawla wa la quwwata illa billah.",
  "sunnahRecitationLeavingHomeTranslation": "In Allah's name, I put my trust in Allah. There is no might or power except through Allah.",
  "sunnahRecitationEatingArabic": "بِسْمِ اللَّهِ",
  "sunnahRecitationEatingPronunciation": "Bismillah.",
  "sunnahRecitationEatingTranslation": "In the name of Allah.",
  "sunnahRecitationSneezingArabic": "الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ\nيَرْحَمُكَ اللَّهُ\nيَهْدِيكُمُ اللَّهُ وَيُصْلِحُ بَالَكُمْ",
  "sunnahRecitationSneezingPronunciation": "Alhamdulillah.\nYarhamukallah.\nYahdikumullahu wa yuslihu balakum.",
  "sunnahRecitationSneezingTranslation": "Praise belongs to Allah.\nMay Allah have mercy on you.\nMay Allah guide you and set your affairs right.",
  "sunnahRecitationSleepArabic": "بِاسْمِكَ أَمُوتُ وَأَحْيَا",
  "sunnahRecitationSleepPronunciation": "Bismika amutu wa ahya.",
  "sunnahRecitationSleepTranslation": "In Your name I die and I live.",
  "sunnahRecitationForgivenessArabic": "أَسْتَغْفِرُ اللَّهَ",
  "sunnahRecitationForgivenessPronunciation": "Astaghfirullah.",
  "sunnahRecitationForgivenessTranslation": "I ask Allah for forgiveness.",
  "sunnahRecitationDifficultyArabic": "لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ الْعَظِيمُ الْحَلِيمُ، لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ رَبُّ الْعَرْشِ الْعَظِيمِ، لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ رَبُّ السَّمَاوَاتِ وَرَبُّ الْأَرْضِ وَرَبُّ الْعَرْشِ الْكَرِيمِ",
  "sunnahRecitationDifficultyPronunciation": "La ilaha illallahul-'azimul-halim. La ilaha illallahu rabbul-'arshil-'azim. La ilaha illallahu rabbus-samawati wa rabbul-ardi wa rabbul-'arshil-karim.",
  "sunnahRecitationDifficultyTranslation": "None is worthy of worship but Allah, the Magnificent, the Forbearing. None is worthy of worship but Allah, Lord of the mighty Throne. None is worthy of worship but Allah, Lord of the heavens, the earth and the noble Throne.",
  "sunnahRecitationRemembranceArabic": "سُبْحَانَ اللَّهِ وَبِحَمْدِهِ",
  "sunnahRecitationRemembrancePronunciation": "Subhanallahi wa bihamdihi.",
  "sunnahRecitationRemembranceTranslation": "Glory and praise belong to Allah.",
  "sunnahRecitationGratitudeArabic": "رَبِّ أَوْزِعْنِي أَنْ أَشْكُرَ نِعْمَتَكَ الَّتِي أَنْعَمْتَ عَلَيَّ وَعَلَىٰ وَالِدَيَّ وَأَنْ أَعْمَلَ صَالِحًا تَرْضَاهُ وَأَدْخِلْنِي بِرَحْمَتِكَ فِي عِبَادِكَ الصَّالِحِينَ",
  "sunnahRecitationGratitudePronunciation": "Rabbi awzi'ni an ashkura ni'matakal-lati an'amta 'alayya wa 'ala walidayya wa an a'mala salihan tardahu wa adkhilni birahmatika fi 'ibadikas-salihin.",
  "sunnahRecitationGratitudeTranslation": "My Lord, enable me to thank You for the blessings You have given me and my parents, to do good that pleases You, and admit me by Your mercy among Your righteous servants.",
  "sunnahRecitationFastingArabic": "الصِّيَامُ جُنَّةٌ",
  "sunnahRecitationFastingPronunciation": "As-siyamu junnah.",
  "sunnahRecitationFastingTranslation": "Fasting is a shield.",
